#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0157 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "Batch's single pin on the [BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE] Scope block (shared with PMDA-AD0221, PMDA-AD0132B). AEDECOD/declared OCCDS put the dataset outside the Include, so the rule never executes even though CRIT1 without CRIT1FL would fire."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col CRIT1   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | AVALGT30
